                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.21/482: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Philip</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-08-29T14:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 29,
                                1919, 2 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Please take no action on Departments Aug. 28, 6 P.M. until further advised.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
